stow
Includes storage and inventory utilities developed in the custom Mouse Wheelie port.
Mouse Wheelie: Copyright 2020–2026 Siphalor and contributors, Apache License 2.0.
Mouse Wheelie's stack combination, chained-permutation client sorting, creative
catalogue lookup and sort modes are retained and adapted for stow's guarded queue.
Storage utilities have been extracted, renamed and modified for this project.
Cloth Config is a separate required dependency, used through its public API.
No third-party configuration library or server networking code is bundled.
